  _dialogue:
    _sentences:
    - 'Hey buddy, bad dream? Same here. '
    - "I dreamt I was watching a movie - it was a horror film, I think. \r"
    - "Every room was dark and filled with corners.\r"
    - 'You were there too, pal. I wonder what this room will look like when it''s
      all corners? '
    - 'Anyways, this is just backstage stuff. But next time you see me, it''lll be
      the real deal. '
    - 'Good night, buddy. '
